Subject: [PATCH 0002] Inject Web3 ethereum provider (resilient integration guide)

Stable injection points for Chromium main / M130+.

POINT 1: chrome/renderer/chrome_content_renderer_client.cc
  In RenderFrameCreated: new web3::Web3RenderFrameObserver(render_frame);

POINT 2-3: chrome/renderer/web3/web3_render_frame_observer.{h,cc}
  DidCreateDocumentElement -> ExecuteScript(kEthereumProviderScript)

POINT 4: chrome/renderer/BUILD.gn add sources

WebView alternative: WebViewCompat.addDocumentStartJavaScript
